/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The AIoT Innovators Challenge 2025 is an exciting opportunity for students to showcase their innovative projects in Robotics, AI, IoT, and STEAM. This challenge aims to empower young minds to think creatively, develop problem-solving skills, and apply technological concepts to real-world problems. With a focus on hands-on learning and innovation, this event is perfect for students looking to make a mark in the world of technology.The challenge is open to students from 3rd to 9th grade, divided into junior and senior levels. Participants will work in teams of two to develop projects that apply technological concepts to solve real-world problems.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
